@host = http://localhost:5105/api
@email = test@example.com
@password = Hemmelig123

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### ---------- Registrering og login ----------
# Koder til e-mail ses i Mailpit: http://localhost:8025 – SMS-koder står i API'ets log.

### Opret konto
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "displayName": "Test",
  "confirmationMethod": "Email"
}

### Bekræft konto med koden fra mailen
POST {{host}}/auth/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "code": "123456",
  "method": "Email"
}

### Login trin 1 – sender engangskode
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Login trin 2 – indsæt koden fra mailen
# @name verify
POST {{host}}/auth/login/2fa
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "twoFactorToken": "{{login.response.body.$.twoFactorToken}}",
  "code": "123456"
}

### Alle requests herunder bruger tokenet fra "Login trin 2"
@token = {{verify.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### ---------- Opgaver ----------

### Hent alle opgaver
GET {{host}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Hent opgaver for én uge
GET {{host}}/tasks?from=2026-11-23&to=2026-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Hent én opgave
GET {{host}}/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Opret opgave
POST {{host}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Gå en tur",
  "description": "30 minutter i frisk luft",
  "scheduledStart": "2026-11-25T09:00:00",
  "scheduledEnd": "2026-11-25T09:30:00"
}

### Rediger opgave
PUT {{host}}/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Gå en lang tur",
  "description": "60 minutter i frisk luft",
  "scheduledStart": "2026-11-25T09:00:00",
  "scheduledEnd": "2026-11-25T10:00:00"
}

### Gennemfør opgave (giver XP og points)
POST {{host}}/tasks/1/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Slet opgave
DELETE {{host}}/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Shop ----------

### Hent genstande i shoppen
GET {{host}}/shop/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Køb genstand
POST {{host}}/shop/items/5/purchase
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Inventar ----------

### Hent inventar
GET {{host}}/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Udstyr genstand
POST {{host}}/inventory/1/equip
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tag genstand af
POST {{host}}/inventory/1/unequip
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Profil ----------

### Hent profil
GET {{host}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Opdater visningsnavn
PUT {{host}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Jacob"
}

### Hent point-historik
GET {{host}}/profile/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Hent indstillinger
GET {{host}}/profile/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Opdater indstillinger
PUT {{host}}/profile/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailEnabled": true,
  "smsEnabled": false,
  "timeZone": "Europe/Copenhagen",
  "twoFactorMethod": "Email"
}

### Send SMS-kode til nyt telefonnummer
POST {{host}}/profile/phone
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+4512345678"
}

### Bekræft telefonnummer med koden fra loggen
POST {{host}}/profile/phone/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+4512345678",
  "code": "123456"
}
